{"workspace_id":"2b9f19fb-beba-49a2-bc1d-9d122ff26e54","revision":4,"source":"synthetic:alder/training-erratum","title":"Unapproved Alder Relay training slide correction","id":"ar-training","text":"Training slide 17 was labelled 'Alder Relay 2.4: three attempts everywhere'. Editorial correction dated 2028-02-10: the slide copied the old 1.8 quickstart and was never approved as the 2.4 retry policy. Do not use it to determine 2.4 defaults or a cluster's effective value. Use the approved 2.4 normative policy together with the signed fleet configuration register.","version":4}